=Published posts in the last 7 days with their latest stored metrics (JSON; may be empty):
{{ JSON.stringify($json.posts) }}

Write the weekly performance report in Markdown answering: 1. What performed well? 2. What performed poorly? 3. Why did it likely happen (label each reason as a hypothesis)? 4. What should we do differently? 5. What content should we create next? Compare formats, pillars, hooks and platforms; look at engagement relative to impressions where both exist. Never invent numbers. Never call a post viral from one metric. If there is little or no data, say exactly that and recommend what to test. Suggest posting-slot changes only if the data supports it.
